          "marks": [
            "em"
          ],
          "text": "By Admizz Education — Trusted Study Abroad Platform"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "71b51305744f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5e9860fc3ee5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Australia has always been one of the most preferred destinations for international students, thanks to its world-class universities, diverse culture, strong job market, and high-quality education system. However, many students worry that they cannot study in Australia without clearing "
        },
        {
          "_key": "3fbf4c9e6c08",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS"
        },
        {
          "_key": "496b93cb2692",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Fortunately, with updated visa guidelines and university-specific language policies, it is now absolutely possible to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "8b6178856303",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "study in Australia without IELTS"
        },
        {
          "_key": "690a94b9f405",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " by choosing the right alternatives."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c1c17384d06a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e4ae079c7d1b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "In this blog, Admizz Education explains the updated rules, accepted language tests, and other pathways that allow students to study in Australia without IELTS in 2025."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a3a965459a9b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "18c00920dfde",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can You Study in Australia Without IELTS?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "8db1f8bcd980",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "eab1ea73d86a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Yes, you can! Several Australian universities now offer admission to students "
        },
        {
          "_key": "ee07e18af138",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "without IELTS"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4bf6d2b1211e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", as long as they meet other English proficiency requirements. Moreover, Australia accepts a wide range of "
        },
        {
          "_key": "f12feb7e9ba4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "IELTS alternatives"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7ee439272aaa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", making the application process easier and more flexible."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c339727cec38",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c310acea801d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Why Australia Allows Alternatives to IELTS"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f5eb3de2fff2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "323d08ca9a8c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Due to increasing global demand, shifting educational needs, and improved language assessment tools, universities have expanded their accepted English tests. Furthermore, the Australian Department of Home Affairs now recognizes multiple exam formats that measure English proficiency accurately."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7c2cae33d7cd",
      "_type": "block",
